==id $Id: owfdiag_lib.sfd 1.0 (17.11.2026) $
* "owfdiag.library" 1.0: GFOpenDiag's part of libowf: the diagram model
* and its formats (draw.io, SVG, PNG with the diagram in it, PDF, EPS,
* outlines, Mermaid, DOT, GraphML, Excalidraw) and GFOpenDiag's editing
* core with its ARexx commands.
* Copyright (c) 2026 AmiCradle Team. MIT licence (see LICENSE).
* The calls are libowf's and the editing core's, with their names and
* types; new calls go at the end. The first 17, libowf's shared calls
* (memory, reports, kinds, zip), are the same calls at the same offsets in
* all of GFOffice's libraries (docs/suite/owf-libraries.md). An array
* argument (owf_dnum box[4]) is its pointer here. odg_port_point returns a
* structure, which a library call can't: odg_port_xy is the call
* (opendiag_proto.h puts odg_port_point back on top of it).
==base _OWFDiagBase
==basetype struct Library *
==libname owfdiag.library
==bias 30
==public
==include <exec/types.h>
==include <owf.h>
==include <owf_zip.h>
==include <owf_diagram.h>
==include <opendiag_core.h>
==include <opendiag_clip.h>
==include <opendiag_order.h>
==include <opendiag_align.h>
==include <opendiag_mind.h>
==include <opendiag_style.h>
==include <opendiag_stencil.h>
==include <opendiag_rexx.h>
==version 1
